# Roaming Throne naming Spider under Spider-Punk. Riot is one of the replacements that modify how the Throne enters, ordered
# with its own "as this enters, choose a creature type" (CR 616.1): with that one applied, the Throne would be a Spider
# (CR 614.12, 616.1f), so Spider-Punk's grant gives it riot, and riot then applies - its choice asked after the type's.

